From 6b3620969fa195fb9946617074043a8c9b9c661b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
Date: Sun, 04 Oct 2026 17:47:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Pen: Relay BLE pen pressure to the touch HAL

Newer Oplus pens (e.g. OnePlus Stylo Pro) only sync with the panel when
the tablet relays data between the pen's vendor GATT service and the
touch HAL. Stock does this inside its Bluetooth stack; do it from the
Pen app instead so no Bluetooth changes are needed.

Gated behind config_penPressureRelay. Allow pen_app to act as a touch
HAL client and the HAL to call back into its clients.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I27afd821daa75c04f226c4abb13dd3eb98ae1841
Signed-off-by: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
---

